# Copy to .env for local use; keep actual credentials out of version control.
# Local tests need no credentials. Cluster settings live in slurm/cluster.env
# (copy slurm/cluster.env.example; see docs/cluster-runbook.md). The model
# servers' API key is generated on the cluster under $HANDOFF_SCRATCH/state/secrets.
# Optional:
# HF_TOKEN=
# WANDB_API_KEY=
